                            <p style="text-align: justify">4.3. Any customer wishing to curtail the length of stay, once that service has commenced, will be liable to pay the fee for the whole of the service already booked.</p>

                            <p style="text-align: justify">4.4. Any alterations made within 24 hours of departure and during the duration of stay will incur a charge of £10.00 for each and every amendment made.</p>

